  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut butternut pumpkin in thin wedges (peel if preferred).\n• Place pumpkin and Persian spice (see ingredients) on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/644b056d8c92dd40c0023f5f/step-b443fb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Finely chop celery and tomato. Roughly chop baby spinach.\n• In a medium bowl, combine celery and tomato. Add a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Season to taste and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/644b056d8c92dd40c0023f5f/step-f83924a2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Melt butter in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water and bring to the boil. Add couscous and vegetable stock powder. Stir to combine, cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/644b056d8c92dd40c0023f5f/step-7e6f258c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir spinach through couscous and divide between bowls.\n• Top with tomato salsa and Persian pumpkin. Crumble fetta over the top and dollop with yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/644b056d8c92dd40c0023f5f/step-e72fc6c3.jpg"
    }
  ]
